---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { PHONE, PHONE_TEL } from '../../../lib/site.ts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Free foundation inspection vs paid independent survey"
  description="How free foundation inspections differ from a paid independent floor elevation survey in Arizona — incentive, language, and pressure."
>
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="page-title">Free foundation inspection vs paid independent survey</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Most foundation repair companies in Arizona offer free inspections. The visit is real. The incentives are different.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>How free inspections work</h2>
      <p>
        Someone comes to the house, looks at cracks, often takes floor readings, and produces a proposal. The cost of that visit is recovered through repair work. That does not make every recommendation dishonest. It does shape what gets emphasized and what tends to stay quiet.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How a paid independent survey works</h2>
      <p>
        You pay for the measurement and the interpretation. There is no repair contract at the end of the visit. The person doing the work has no financial reason to find a project.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Practical differences</h2>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><strong>Incentive</strong> — Free inspections are the front end of a sales process. Paid independent work ends with information.</li>
        <li><strong>Language</strong> — Independent reports more often include “monitor,” “improve drainage first,” or “this may not get worse.”</li>
        <li><strong>Timing pressure</strong> — Free inspections frequently carry urgency. Independent work does not need you to decide the same day.</li>
        <li><strong>Scope</strong> — Some free inspections are brief. A proper independent survey is methodical and produces a usable contour map and written summary.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Neither approach is automatically right or wrong. The question is whether you want the person measuring your floors to have a financial interest in the next step.
      </p>
      <div class="contact-box">
        <p><strong>Want the independent version?</strong></p>
        <a class="phone-link" href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`}>{PHONE}</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
